### Error cases

### Create notification with empty message (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "",
  "date": "2026-03-09T21:15:00"
}

### Create notification with missing message field (should fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/notifications/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "date": "2026-03-09T21:15:00"
}
